// W06 B10: DIRTY Side execution of one component row (no merge). The row must be valid (17 row arrays / 7 member pools
// of one length, member slice inside, ID > 0, kind LOCAL / BROAD_ONLY, cfgRevision current, stage FULL_GREEDY, used
// ALL_CLEAR). Both Sides computed -> true with no W05 call. Otherwise runFilterOrdersRaw once and
// W05Cand.selectComponentBothSides exactly once (runDomain 1 for LOCAL, 2 for BROAD_ONLY) on the filtered enumerators.
// The W05 output is validated (Side status -1 or >= 0; logical winner count = Support + Resistance counts; equal record
// array sizes; each record's Side value, root slice and every root ID inside the component snapshot, a LOCAL record
// holding a MEMBER; W05's Side scan epochs = input epoch + 1 / + 2 in Side order or na (na only for a failed Side) and
// its final epoch = input epoch + the number of scans it reported). Only DIRTY
// Sides are materialized, in the PHASE A stride-16 layout (16 ints with field 14 = new root offset, 1 reference price,
// the root IDs in W05 order) and the seen slice (the snapshot's INCLUDED_BROAD Roots whose W05 seen epoch equals that
// Side's scan epoch, rootId ascending). W05 status -1 is a computed result. Capacity is checked before any append; a
// structural failure pops the four pools back and leaves every row field untouched; a computed Side is never written.
// Seen epoch: inCandidateBroadSeenEpoch goes to W05 and W05's own returned final candidateBroadSeenEpoch is propagated
